{
 "//": [
  "Golden values for the vendor schematics, recorded by tests/update_golden.py.",
  "",
  "The schematics themselves are confidential and are not in this repository.",
  "Nothing here reveals one: a board is identified by the sha256 of its PDF,",
  "which the suite uses to find it locally, and the output is recorded as counts",
  "and as one-way digests. A digest cannot be inverted, so committing it",
  "publishes no net name, no pin assignment and no part number - but it still",
  "fails the moment the conversion changes. When it does, the actual output is",
  "written to tests/.actual/<id>/ for a local diff.",
  "",
  "known_defects records behaviour that is wrong but currently accepted, so the",
  "suite is green without pretending. Each entry is asserted exactly: a new",
  "defect fails, and so does fixing a recorded one - which is the point, since",
  "the fixture then has to be updated deliberately.",
  "",
  "  unaccounted_roles       nets that reached neither the config.h nor a",
  "                          warning explaining their absence",
  "  dangling_timer_labels   TIMER_PIN_MAPPING entries naming a define the file",
  "                          never makes - the target would not compile",
  "  unvalidated_pin_defines pin defines the firmware tables do not support for",
  "                          that function",
  "  incomplete_spi_buses    a bus missing one of SCK/SDI/SDO",
  "  instances_without_pins  a device pointed at a bus whose pins were not",
  "                          emitted"
 ],
